From: howeasy <howardabudd@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 20:43:54 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] slink: lossless pureRGB support (4.6.1-slink1)

Patches 1-8 of docs/purergb/research/d1/FORK_BRIEF.md, see FORK_CHANGES.md.
LosslessMode entries load->save byte-identically; enabled categories write
only their own species/level/item bytes; vanilla entries produce the same
bytes as the 4.6.1 release jar for a fixed seed.

